› 1. [*] Automatic account selection              Choose and switch accounts when
                                                  needed.
  2. [*] Start unused weekly windows              Keep imported accounts ready to
                                                  use.
  3. [ ] Auto-redeem usage resets (Experimental)  Use earned resets before expiry
                                                  or a distant weekly reset.
  4. [ ] Keep retrying at capacity                After 1, 2, 5, and 15 minutes,
                                                  retry every 15 minutes.
  5. [ ] Compact tool activity                    Keep routine tool details in
                                                  Ctrl+T instead of the main
                                                  conversation.

  Press space to toggle; enter to save or manage; esc to cancel
